{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "18歳のお誕生日を迎えてからもうすぐ2ヶ月が経とうとしており、なんと高校の卒業式も無事に迎えました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "……こんな事実、信じられません。\nというか信じたくありません矢田萌華です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "子供の頃はずっとずっと、\n｢早く大人になりたい！｣と思っていたし、何もかもが自由そうに見えていた大人の世界が羨ましくてたまりませんでした。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "しかしどうでしょう。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いざ、成人したとなると急に、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もう少し子供でいたかった"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もう少しだけ｢こども｣という立場を楽しみたかった"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そんな気持ちでいます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いや、｢子供って楽しいよ｣と少し遠い目をしていた親の気持ちを理解してしまった時点で、もう｢大人｣になっているのかもしれない。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "むなしすぎーーー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "※まあ私は“(自認)お姉さん”という称号を手に入れたので大丈夫です。(※2)"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "※2 あくまでも自認。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "スクロールという無駄な運動を皆さんにさせてしまったところで、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本題に入ろうと思います。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本題というか、今回はもうほとんど"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "｢ オフショット回 ｣"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みたいな感じです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まずはこちら"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "【乃木坂46リズムフェスティバル リアルイベント】"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私がここにいる理由…その原点となったひとつでもある、｢ガールズルール｣の衣装を選びました！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202603/mobXfds8M.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "可愛くも思い入れもある、大好きな衣装です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "加入したてのときに、EX大衆さんでも着させていただいた思い出もあります。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あれほんとに楽しかったな〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202603/mob4aFq4M.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "全身も載せてみちゃう"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "次はこちら"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "【乃木恋 リアルイベント】"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "｢気づいたら片想い｣のときの制服を選ばせていただきました。\n実は私この制服がだいすきで、、\nずっと着てみたかったからにこにこ^^)♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202603/mobMUAy6j.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "衣装に合わせて珍しくハーフツインも。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "少しばかり短かったかもだけど、珍しく顔の写真を載せちゃったりなんかして、\n矢田萌華的カロリー消費の高い写真を載せたんで勘弁してほしいのです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "このわたしも"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202603/mobtlFgsU.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "好きだった？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "#イツノマニカスキダッタ"}], "source": "official"}